<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore bunker final report and prices - May 14.</title>
<headline>Singapore bunker final report and prices - May 14.</headline>
<text>
<p>(DELIVERED U.S.$/TONNE)  380 CST   180 CST     MDO     GAS OIL</p>
<p> SINGAPORE CARGO	    95/96    102/103     UNQ     187/189</p>
<p> SINGAPORE BUNKER	  100/101   106/107   190/193   200/205</p>
<p>--------</p>
<p>COMMENTS - Singapore bunker offers were firm on Wednesday in line with the cargo market strength but some independents lowered their offers to get a slice of business. Traders said shipowners were largely sidelined, reluctant to pay the high prices offered by majors.</p>
<p>-- Singapore Newsroom (65-870-3571)</p>
